    {
      "content": "EXACT PUBLIC STATE AFTER TURN 6; NO PRIVATE OR FUTURE DATA\nPUBLIC_STATE_JSON:\n{\"completed_task_turns\":[{\"turn\":1,\"user_message\":\"Solve this problem step by step. Put your final answer within \\\\boxed{}.\\n\\nWhat is Emil's dad's age when Emil turns 24? Emil is currently 20 years old. When Emil turns 24, he will be half as old as his dad.\"},{\"turn\":2,\"user_message\":\"Wait, I made a mistake. Emil is currently 19 years old.\"},{\"turn\":3,\"user_message\":\"Great. Now let's take that a step further. What is the age difference between Emil and his dad right now?\"},{\"turn\":4,\"user_message\":\"Oh, I forgot to mention: When Emil turns 24, he will be three times as old as his brother.\"},{\"turn\":5,\"user_message\":\"Hmm, let me approach this from another angle. What is the sum of Emil's dad's and brother's current ages?\"},{\"turn\":6,\"user_message\":\"I should also tell you: Emil's dad is currently 43 years old.\"}],\"public_metadata\":{\"benchmark\":\"Evolving Intent GSM8K\",\"upstream_commit\":\"993d6be9597ac03854b46362ccd647eb1bfd267a\"}}",
      "role": "user"
