    },
    {
      "content": "When Emil turns 24, his dad will be:\n\n\\[\n43+(24-19)=43+5=48\n\\]\n\nThe corrected brother information does not change this. Therefore, Emil’s dad will be:\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{48\\text{ years old}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    }
