  "task_assistant_messages": [
    "1. Emil is currently 20, so he will turn 24 in 4 years.\n2. At that time, Emil will be half his dad’s age.\n3. Therefore, his dad’s age will be:\n\n\\[\n2 \\times 24 = 48\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{48\\text{ years old}}\n\\]",
    "Emil will be 24 in 5 years. At that time, he will be half his dad’s age:\n\n\\[\n\\text{Dad's age}=2\\times 24=48\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{48\\text{ years old}}\n\\]",
    "The age difference stays constant. When Emil is 24 and his dad is 48, the difference is:\n\n\\[\n48-24=24\n\\]\n\nSo, right now Emil is 19 and his dad is \\(19+24=43\\).\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{24\\text{ years}}\n\\]",
